{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Give thanks to YHWH, call upon His name</b> — David's word to Israel when they bore the Ark, for so it is written, and the testimony is that he speaks to the people of Israel, for he said, \"seed of Abraham.\"" "And the meaning of <b>call upon His name</b> — to make known the way of the Name, as with Abraham: \"and he called upon the name of YHWH, El olam\" (Genesis 21:33)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 105, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:38:20.411924435Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}